      "id": 59605,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-12T21:26:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think Visionary gets to determine the damage type whenever the Twisted target would deal damage, therefore she's able to override any current damage-type-changing effects (eg Imbued Fire, toxic vat thingy) on such targets.</p>",
